#
# === The species altitude ===
#
# BEAM/OTP runtime altitude. Per Alex Round-3 spawn brief verbatim:
#
#   > "And the BEAM as the production grade implementation of the
#   >  Principal Bundle Tower."
#
# @beam/system is the substrate-decl'd species of @system on BEAM
# substrate. The composition three altitudes converge at this species:
