#
# Alex Round-3 directive: **kills gen_prism as framing**. The prior
# framing was that `@spectral/gen_prism` was mirror's `gen_server`
# analogue at BEAM/process altitude — accurate at species altitude
# but insufficient at family-root altitude. The correct framing is
# that @beam/system NAMES the whole viable-system-on-BEAM substrate;
# @spectral/gen_prism carries S1 (worker) altitude ONLY; @spectral/
# supervisor carries S3 (supervision-connection) altitude; @dance
# carries S2 (coordination-connection) altitude; @spectral/db carries
